alth Find, 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.26, 0.55, 0.79, 0.94, 1.44, 1.74, 1.84, 1.97, 2.22, 2.31, 2.58]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "form", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[1]"], "text": "The third lead: the lines for owners’ draws, dividends and transfers are blank in every report.", "t0": 71.64, "t1": 76.45, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "The equity page, every 2025 report", "rows": [["Owners’ draws", "blank"], ["Dividends", "blank"], ["Related-party transfers", "blank"]]}, "emph": ["blank"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.43, 0.95, 1.13, 1.42, 1.58, 1.89, 2.52, 2.98, 3.07, 3.62, 3.75, 4.05, 4.16, 4.4]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[2]"], "text": "Yet the homes did pay related companies: 6.2 million to Theragen, for therapy.", "t0": 76.57, "t1": 80.99, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Paid to related companies by the group’s homes, 2025", "rows": [["Theragen, therapy services", "$6.2 million"], ["Life Generations Healthcare, management fees", "$4.5 million"], ["Real Estate Entity 3, building lease", "$2.4 million"], ["Real Estate - San Jose Note, building lease", "$884,837"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.3, 0.62, 0.86, 1.09, 1.44, 2.16, 2.42, 2.66, 2.87, 3.18, 3.26, 3.79, 3.98]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[2]"], "text": "4.5 million in management fees, and building leases to related landlords.", "t0": 81.11, "t1": 85.02, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Paid to related companies by the group’s homes, 2025", "rows": [["Theragen, therapy services", "$6.2 million"], ["Life Generations Healthcare, management fees", "$4.5 million"], ["Real Estate Entity 3, building lease", "$2.4 million"], ["Real Estate - San Jose Note, building lease", "$884,837"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.49, 0.78, 1.07, 1.17, 1.57, 2.03, 2.22, 2.56, 2.87, 3.01, 3.39]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "actors[3]"], "text": "The fou