here the cash went, or whether it can be repaid.", "t0": 106.81, "t1": 110.25, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Where the cash went", "Whether it can be repaid, or carries interest", "Whether any of it reached the owners"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.5, 0.72, 0.94, 1.09, 1.19, 1.53, 2.11, 2.32, 2.59, 2.67, 2.81, 2.95]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Or whether any of it reached the owners.", "t0": 110.37, "t1": 111.96, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Where the cash went", "Whether it can be repaid, or carries interest", "Whether any of it reached the owners"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.44, 0.62, 0.73, 0.85, 1.09, 1.24]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["innocent[0]", "innocent[2]"], "text": "A central treasury or a loan agreement could explain it, and the 2025 reports aren’t audited.", "t0": 112.08, "t1": 116.7, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The 2025 reports are as submitted, not audited."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.45, 0.87, 0.98, 1.04, 1.24, 1.6, 1.76, 2.17, 2.5, 2.69, 2.8, 3.09, 3.64, 4.03, 4.27]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The group’s audited statements, its cash agreement, and the State’s own audit.", "t0": 116.82, "t1": 121.58, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "Life Generations Healthcare", "what": "audited 2025 statements and cash-management agreement"}, {"who": "The State", "what": "its audit of the 2025 reports"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.34, 0.64, 1.1, 1.25, 1.54, 1.89, 2.46, 2.68, 2.97, 3.52, 3.77, 3.89, 4.3, 4.51]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "defense[0]"], "text": "No authority has made a finding about these homes.", "t0": 121.7, "t1": 123.95, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.63, 0.76, 0.92, 1.02, 1.39, 1.62, 1.83]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text":